What is the output of the following code?

a = np.array([1, 2, 3])
b = np.array([[1], [2], [3]])
print(a + b)
Options:
A) [[2, 3, 4], [3, 4, 5], [4, 5, 6]]
B) [2, 4, 6]
C) [[2], [4], [6]]
D) Error (shape mismatch)
code:
import numpy as np
a = np.array([1, 2, 3])     #shape(3,)-1d array
b = np.array([[1], [2], [3]])  #shape(3,1)--2d array/matrix
print(a + b)
output:[[2,3,4],
        [3,4,5],
